WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.766 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
Your job is to name the relationship, then find the words

00:00:02.766 --> 00:00:04.931 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
that create it.

00:00:05.831 --> 00:00:08.103 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
Read the whole sentence first. A lantern can be lit only

00:00:08.103 --> 00:00:10.375 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
if its wick is dry.

00:00:11.275 --> 00:00:15.029 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
Notice only if. Those words make a dry wick necessary for

00:00:15.029 --> 00:00:18.784 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
lighting the lantern. That is a conditional relationship.

00:00:19.684 --> 00:00:22.447 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
Write the type, then quote the indicator: Conditional, only if. Give

00:00:22.447 --> 00:00:25.209 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
both parts of the answer.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:29.146 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
A causal relationship says one thing produces or changes another. The

00:00:29.146 --> 00:00:32.182 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
room warmed because the heater switched on. Here, because gives the

00:00:32.182 --> 00:00:35.219 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
cause.

00:00:36.119 --> 00:00:39.532 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
A comparative relationship compares things. This lamp is brighter than that

00:00:39.532 --> 00:00:42.945 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
one. Brighter than makes the comparison.

00:00:43.845 --> 00:00:47.056 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sometimes a sentence contains more than one type. If the lamp

00:00:47.056 --> 00:00:50.267 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
is on, the room is brighter than the hallway. If is

00:00:50.267 --> 00:00:53.477 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
conditional. Brighter than is comparative. Include each type with its own

00:00:53.477 --> 00:00:56.688 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
indicator words.

00:00:57.588 --> 00:01:00.650 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
Read the sentence. Name each relationship type. Quote the words that

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:03.711 line:90% position:50% size:90% align:center
create it. You're ready to start.

